  {
    "number": 448,
    "title": "Add nightly guide refresh tooling and retired-term checks",
    "body": "The guide refresh currently requires manual history collection and does not detect retired terms in saved story text. This draft adds deterministic history and report helpers, staged input collection that preserves prior data on failed reads, and exact retired-term detection.\n\nRefs #315, #316, #311, #341. Integration is in progress: no scheduler is installed yet, shared guide edits and regeneration await the #440 owner handoff, and tracker assessment proceeds separately with immediate rereads and guarded readbacks. Direction prose and its existing checks are unchanged. Public publication and #317 are excluded.\n\nThe owner selected 03:00 America/New_York and authorized checks: write only for exact-commit validation results. The initial workflow-dispatch bootstrap order is awaiting the owner decision. The repository currently disallows Actions-created PRs; enabling that setting remains a separate prerequisite to the real rolling-PR validation.\n\nValidation so far: 16 focused helper tests pass, including retained input on failed reads, timestamp-only no-change, rolling-branch metadata churn, retired notes and missing retirement keys, history parity/order, and closure reporting without invented labels. The existing 57 maintenance tests and Node 24 workflow checks (15 tests) pass at the initial base. Early read-only review findings were reproduced and fixed; final Standards and Specification reviews and applicable CI are still pending.\n\nThis is documentation tooling, with no product contract change and no OpenSpec delta. It does not install hooks, change the runtime, or contact devices.\n",
    "state": "open",
    "html_url": "https://github.com/jimmie-potts/agent-device-hub/pull/448",
    "updated_at": "2026-09-26T06:39:06Z",
    "draft": true,
    "head": {
      "label": "jimmie-potts:codex/gh-315-nightly-guide",
      "ref": "codex/gh-315-nightly-guide",
      "sha": "2118c05ce47de056dbcc45419c5490d2599e3b92",
      "user": {
        "login": "jimmie-potts",
        "id": 49133657,
        "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjQ5MTMzNjU3",
        "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/49133657?v=4",
        "gravatar_id": "",
        "url": "https://api.github.com/users/jimmie-potts",
        "html_url": "https://github.com/jimmie-potts",
        "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/jimmie-potts/followers",
